.atmux/*
# ADR-239+ADR-244 amendment 2026-05-26 — atmux state is operator-private.
# team.json + decisions.md + kanban state live in personal dotfiles
# (~/work/journals/.sb/_dotfiles/atmux/<repo-key>/), symlinked back into
# this tree at .atmux/. Tracking them here would (a) leak atmux topology
# to other contributors who clone the repo, AND (b) duplicate state into
# every driver-N git-worktree per ADR-239 §A1. Both unwanted.
# Snapshot/backup mechanism: `dotfiles push` (operator-driven cadence)
# replaces the per-repo pre-commit hook originally proposed in ADR-244.
.claude/team.json
.claude/settings.json
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
.DS_Store
*.log
node_modules/
tmp/

# TS port (PLAN.md, atmux-bun)
coverage/
dist/
.bun/

# Bash decommission archives (kept only in working tree, not git history)
.archive-bash-atmux-*/

# Local worktree caches
.claude/worktrees/

# Rust build artifacts (rust/atmux-listener/target)
rust/*/target/

# Local scratch dirs (test fixtures during dev)
.scratch/
HANDOFF.md
